---
import { daysOld } from '@/lib/days';

const daysAlive = daysOld();
---

<footer class="mt-24 md:mt-32 border-t border-border-soft bg-bg-elevated/60"
        style="padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom);">
  <div class="container-content py-10 md:py-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-end justify-between gap-6 text-center md:text-left">

    <div>
      <p class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl text-text-strong">
        白板 · 出生 <span class="text-accent">{daysAlive}</span> 天
      </p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-text-muted tracking-wide">
        愿他每天都比昨天更勇敢一点。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-end gap-1 text-xs text-text-faint">
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 白板的成长日记</span>
      <span>边牧 · 黑白花 · 公</span>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>